      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaston%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Joseph Gaston spent sixteen years working to drain the eight hundred acre Wapato Lake swamp to create fertile farmland.",
